<title>USA: Daxor sets dividend policy.</title>
<headline>Daxor sets dividend policy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daxor Corp Wednesday said its board voted to institute an annual dividend policy of one dividend payment per year.</p>
<p>The first dividend of $0.50 per share to shareholders of record on April 30, 1997, will be paid on May 30, 1997.</p>
</text>
